From dddcc11b582dce095e8aa86906fbf0098a4f4242 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 17:30:27 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] tools: ship the qwen4exp MTP sidecar builders with Strata's
 fetch tool; README credits every model publisher

tools/qwen4exp-mtp-sidecar/ carries our sidecar builder and draft-vocabulary builder, Strata's mtp_fetch.py and its test (MIT, copied unchanged from Niko1221/Strata v0.1.40.1), pinned inputs and the sha256 of both served sidecars. licenses/strata-MIT.txt, a NOTICE row and a licenses/README.md row retain Strata's licence. README: the sidecar section states its true source (ashbash's Q8_0 MTP drafter, checked tensor by tensor against Qwen's BF16 checkpoint), links the folder instead of "next update", and Credits name every model publisher measured on the page. media/arifilabs-llama-cpp-banner.webp, the banner the README already links, is added (it was missing, a broken image), with the release version v0.1.3.0 under the Arifi Labs line.

Origin: lane-298 (build_sidecar.py, make_dvocab_sidecar.py, tools README; fork commit 7dbdd07317) and ArifiLabs (native) for the README text.
Taken-from: Niko1221/Strata@82f46a8c8f475f001ad76d92f58f4a4f8ffb0253 (tools/mtp_fetch.py, tools/test_mtp_fetch.py, LICENSE; copied unchanged)
Measured-effect: none on the engine (tools and documents only); the shipped scripts regenerate both served sidecars with identical tensors (lane 298 cells/sidecar-regen.txt).
